nodes.body:
Thanks for catching this. You are right that `n` in a chat request represents parallel sampling for a single prompt, rather than the batch size.

I updated `inject_request_id_into_value` so that the gateway always injects one scalar logical request ID instead of constructing a `rid` array from `batch_size`:

```json
{
  "rid": "router-rid"
}

